Subject: [PATCH] Preserve random texture aliases, sampler modes and source identity

Strip mode qualification before randNN prefix filtering. Reuse only the selected
image for a preset slot, recreating each descriptor with its requested alias and
sampler. Bind the emitted short randNN uniform to the same unit as its long alias.
Retain source paths and base names for runtime association diagnostics.
ProjectM TV-specific fix; production random_device seeding is unchanged.

---
